{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20177","headline":"喷玉布 · 孟郊","name":"喷玉布","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去尘咫尺步，山笑康乐岩。\n天开紫石屏，泉缕明月帘。\n仙凝刻削迹，灵绽云霞纤。\n悦闻若有待，瞥见终无厌。\n俗玩讵能近，道嬉方可淹。\n踏着不死机，欲归多浮嫌。\n古醉今忽醒，今求古仍潜。\n古今相共失，语默两难恬。\n赠君喷玉布，一濯高崭崭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20177.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20177","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}